		"name": "VidyaSetu Settings Page API Tests",
		"description": "Comprehensive test suite for Settings Page API endpoints: Profile Update (PUT /api/auth/profile), Change Password (POST /api/auth/change-password), Token Refresh, and Logout. Run requests in order within each folder.",
